OL,3,GNEWSAVotes of no confidence in Sinn
OL,4,AFein ministers fail
OL,5,
OL,6,FVotes of no confidence in First
OL,7,FMinister Michelle O'Neill and three
OL,8,Fother Sinn Fein ministers have fallen
OL,9,Fafter failing to secure enough support
OL,10,Fin Stormont.
OL,12,FThe Northern Ireland Assembly debated
OL,13,Fthe no-confidence motions over the
OL,14,Fministers' handling of the Drumcree
OL,15,Fdispute, after they received the
OL,16,Fbacking of unionist parties last week.
OL,18,FHowever, the attempt to oust them
OL,19,Ffailed as it required cross-community
OL,20,Fsupport from a majority of both
OL,21,Funionists and nationalists in the
OL,22,Fassembly.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
