OL,3,GNEWSAVotes of no confidence in Sinn
OL,4,AFein ministers fail
OL,5,
OL,6,FO'Neill described the move as
OL,7,F"pointless" but Deputy First Minister
OL,8,FEmma Little-Pengelly said her
OL,9,Fpower-sharing partner had "shattered"
OL,10,Fpublic confidence and needed to be held
OL,11,Faccountable.
